markdown_text = "# Character Notes

Working notes for the playable / NPC character sprites. Each entry lists the
asset folder, the base sprite file, and a short description. Names are still
undecided unless stated otherwise.

---

## Female Characters

### Character 02 — `female/02/Character_002.png`
![Character 02](res://assets/characters/female/02/Character_002_Face_64x64.png)
- _Name undecided._ No description yet.

### Character 05 — `female/05/Character_005.png`
![Character 05](res://assets/characters/female/05/Character_005_Face_64x64.png)
- _Name undecided._ Brown hair, red eyes, yellow shirt.

